vals, mock submissions, and payment checks tied to the case. React / Vite / Python / FastAPI / LangGraph Read case study ↗Live site ↗ 06 / 2025 Full-stack · Backend Yap Chat Realtime messaging & WebRTC Room-scoped realtime chat and 8-way peer-to-peer video: JWT-verified Socket.IO identity, a glare-free WebRTC mesh where media never touches the server, and 35/35 tests passing against a live server. Node.js / Express 5 / Socket.IO / WebRTC / MongoDB Read case study ↗Live site ↗ 07 / 2026 AI · Full-stack · Backend Scribb Creative platform & journal AI A deployed sketchbook and journal platform with tactile page turns, public creator profiles and a private-journal AI companion. React, Express and FastAPI share a Postgres data model with versioned saves and owner-scoped retrieval. React / TypeScript / Express / PostgreSQL / Neon / Python Read case study ↗Live site ↗ 08 / 2026 AI · Backend KOE (声) Voice agent & workspace Gemini Live voice calls, chat and voice notes over one FastAPI tool registry. GitHub, Calendar, Docs, Sheets and Notion workflows share a persisted approval gate; an exclusive audio coordinator keeps Spotify and conversations from competing. Python / FastAPI / Gemini Live / PostgreSQL / Neon / React Read case study ↗Live site ↗ 09 / 2026 Backend Shiori Go server hardening A security-hardened fork of a Go/Echo media server: audited ~300 routes, closed a critical unauthenticated network exposure, added per-IP rate limiting, lockout and a strict CSP, and runs sandboxed JavaScript providers with automatic failover. 23/23 attack probes pass. Go / Echo / GORM / SQLite / WebSockets Read case study ↗Live site ↗ 10 / 2025 Full-stack Forcaster Weather interface A minimal weather client: OpenWeather data through a thin Axios layer, 5-day and 24-hour forecasts in expandable views, and a backdrop that follows the conditions. React / Vite / Tailwind / OpenWeather / Axios Read case study ↗Live site ↗ (Email)[email] (How to reach me)Fastest way to reach me is email. Link
